{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50860","headline":"省题诗二十一首 咏白 · 王棨","name":"省题诗二十一首 咏白","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"非青玄赤黄，正色配金方。\n鱼表周王德，麟呈汉帝祥。\n寒来边草远，春至岭梅芳。\n曳练闻良马，衔钩见瑞狼。\n张苍肥似瓠，潘岳鬓如霜。\n虚室能生後，方知守黑长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王棨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50860.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50860","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}